    "title": "Prince Harry says it is 'great' to be back in Britain after six years in US - NewsBreak",
    "text": "21 hours ago The Duke of Sussex has said it feels \"great\" to be back in Britain after spending six years living in California. He told Canadian network CTV: \"It's been great. It's been great to be back on British soil. The kids are happy in school and it gives me a chance to be able to really focus on the Invictus Games in Birmingham in July next year.\" Read full article",
